# Visibility (OBSERVED)

See `docs/VISIBILITY.md`.

- Provider: DigitalOcean Inference Responses API + server-side `web_search`.
- Auth: `AEO_LLM_API_KEY` only.
- Per query record: query, answer, mention, citation, target-domain-in-sources, source URLs, rates.
- `llm_used` = Responses HTTP call executed.
- `retrieval_used` = web_search tool evidence present (not merely `--live` flag).
- No semantic judgment of question quality here — that is LLM-owned upstream.
- Do not measure or claim consumer ChatGPT / Gemini / Perplexity UI ranking.
